{"title":"2005 Alabama ARML TST Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For how many <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Ordered_pair\" title=\"Ordered pair\">ordered pairs</a> of <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Digit\" title=\"Digit\">digits</a> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/0/bb0c75d9abe3e693ba0bb677cecbb923cefd81af.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(A,B)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"49\" height=\"18\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/6/16662bf8b1645f757c3debcc07f1a53978620dd5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2AB8$\" width=\"46\" height=\"13\" /> a <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Multiple\" title=\"Multiple\">multiple</a> of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/f/edf074831eb5bc9e61d6d6e09f525a86e3068f6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A number is divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/f/edf074831eb5bc9e61d6d6e09f525a86e3068f6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> if it is divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. A number is divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> if its last two digits are divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/d/88dfa6c21fe80b94852e70796c0227a0a3426fa8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4|\\overline{B8} \\Longrightarrow B = 0,2,4,6,8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"193\" height=\"20\" />. A number is divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> if the sum of its digits is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, so\n</p>\n<ul><li><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/9/6693847914736b840c808993697eaf997685e614.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3| s(2A08) = 10 + A \\Longrightarrow A = 2,5,8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"276\" height=\"18\" /> - 3 solutions</li>\n<li><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/4/c8434b8ead42a1f5d8bcb65eba9f13a32e103731.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3| s(2A28) = 12 + A \\Longrightarrow A = 0,3,6,9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"293\" height=\"18\" /> - 4 solutions</li>\n<li><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/1/4e196dc4d8bf0b9c930aced40477af7ec2715cf4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3| s(2A48) = 14 + A \\Longrightarrow A = 1,4,7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"276\" height=\"18\" /> - 3 solutions</li>\n<li><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/5/b351370b75fdca807f1100fe63ba0ff81eaab48d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3| s(2A68) = 16 + A \\Longrightarrow A = 2,5,8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"276\" height=\"18\" /> - 3 solutions</li>\n<li><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/4/034be198ccffbd006a0259c7c982c40ebc7953c7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3| s(2A88) = 18 + A \\Longrightarrow A = 0,3,6,9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"293\" height=\"18\" /> - 4 solutions</li></ul>\n<p>These sum to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/6/b7616a230c77f0d9a577e5bca01aa06f1c35c457.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$17$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Alabama_ARML_TST\" title=\"2005 Alabama ARML TST\">2005 Alabama ARML TST</a> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems\" title=\"2005 Alabama ARML TST Problems\">(Problems)</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by:<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2005 Alabama ARML TST Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by:<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Probl